 "main": "\n<div id=\"container\"><div id=\"content\" role=\"main\"><nav class=\"woocommerce-breadcrumb\" itemprop=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"@@ROOT@@/index.html\">Trang chủ</a> / <a href=\"@@ROOT@@/cua-hang/index.html\">Sản phẩm</a> / <a href=\"@@ROOT@@/danh-muc/san-pham-khac/index.html\">SẢN PHẨM KHÁC</a> / Bạt tự cuốn Hòa Phát</nav>\n<div class=\"post-1692 product type-product status-publish has-post-thumbnail product_cat-san-pham-khac first instock shipping-taxable product-type-simple\" id=\"product-1692\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Product\">\n<div class=\"images single-product-images\">\n<a class=\"woocommerce-main-image zoom\" data-rel=\"prettyPhoto[product-gallery]\" href=\"#\" itemprop=\"image\" title=\"\"><img alt=\"su-dung-bat-che-dung-cach-1\" class=\"attachment-shop_single size-shop_single wp-post-image\" height=\"339\" src=\"@@ROOT@@/assets/uploads/2017/12/su-dung-bat-che-dung-cach-1-400x339.png\" title=\"su-dung-bat-che-dung-cach-1\" width=\"400\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbnails columns-3\"><div class=\"item\"><a class=\"zoom first\" data-rel=\"prettyPhoto[product-gallery]\" href=\"#\" title=\"\"><img alt=\"su-dung-bat-che-dung-cach-1\" class=\"attachment-shop_thumbnail size-shop_thumbnail\" height=\"180\" sizes=\"(max-width: 180px) 100vw, 180px\" src=\"@@ROOT@@/assets/uploads/2017/12/su-dung-bat-che-dung-cach-1-180x180.png\" srcset=\"@@ROOT@@/assets/uploads/2017/12/su-dung-bat-che-dung-cach-1-180x180.png 180w, @@ROOT@@/assets/uploads/2017/12/su-dung-bat-che-dung-cach-1-150x150.png 150w, @@ROOT@@/assets/uploads/2017/12/su-dung-bat-che-dung-cach-1-300x300.png 300w\" title=\"su-dung-bat-che-dung-cach-1\" width=\"180\"/></a></div><div class=\"item\"><a class=\"zoom\" data-rel=\"prettyPhoto[product-gallery]\" href=\"#\" title=\"\"><img alt=\"cach-su-dung-va-bao-quan-bat-cuon-tu-dong-600×563\" class=\"attachment-shop_thumbnail size-shop_thumbnail\" height=\"180\" sizes=\"(max-width: 180px) 100vw, 180px\" src=\"@@ROOT@@/assets/uploads/2